@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 38
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Developer\nRelease Engineer" as Dev
participant "Trace UI" as UI
participant "Decision\nSynthesis" as DS

Dev -> UI: Build decision overview
UI -> DS: Request synthesis of dependency results
DS -> DS: Classify work and repository contexts
DS --> UI: Decision-oriented summary
UI --> Dev: Support release decision
@enduml
